PET STORE SALES & CUSTOMER SEGMENTATION DASHBOARD
=================================================

PROJECT OVERVIEW :
This project is created using Tableau to analyze pet store sales, profitability, and customer behavior.

TOOLS USED :
- Tableau
- Excel / CSV Dataset

DATASET : 
The dataset contains pet store transaction and customer
information.

Main fields used in the project:
- Customer ID
- Order Date
- Sales
- Profit
- Quantity
- Region
- Category
- Discount

Customer analysis also uses:
- Recency
- Frequency
- Monetary Value

DASHBOARD 1 - SALES & PROFITABILITY
- Total Sales
- Total Profit
- Total Quantity
- Profit Ratio
- Sales by Category
- Profit by Region
- Monthly Sales Trend
- Category Filter
- Region Filter

DASHBOARD 2 - CUSTOMER SEGMENTATION
- Customer Segmentation Scatter Plot
- Customer Trend Line
- Customers by Segment
- High Value Customers
- Customer Clustering
- Cluster Filter

RFM ANALYSIS : 
- Recency
- Frequency
- Monetary Value

PROFIT RATIO
Profit Ratio = SUM(Profit) / SUM(Sales)

PURPOSE
To analyze sales, profit, customer behavior, and customer segments using interactive Tableau dashboards.

CONCLUSION
The Pet Store Sales & Customer Segmentation Dashboard  provides an interactive way to analyze sales, profitability, customer behavior, and customer groups.
The project demonstrates how Tableau can transformtransaction data into meaningful visualizations and interactive dashboards for business analysis.
